      "path": "tui_app/app.mbt",
      "line": 25,
      "kinds": [
        "ptp_messages"
      ],
      "text": "/// 每条排队消息渲染成 `Follow-up: <text>`,按宽度截断。",
      "excerpt_start_column": 1,
      "match_column": 16
    },
    {
      "path": "tui_app/app.mbt",
      "line": 34,
      "kinds": [
        "ptp_messages"
      ],
      "text": "      let prefix = if index == 0 { \"  Follow-up: \" } else { \"    \" }",
      "excerpt_start_column": 1,
      "match_column": 39
    },
    {
      "path": "tui_app/README.mbt.md",
      "line": 16,
      "kinds": [
        "ptp_messages"
      ],
      "text": "- **PendingList** — agent 忙时排队的输入,每行 `Follow-up: <text>`",
      "excerpt_start_column": 1,
      "match_column": 39
    },
    {
      "path": "tui_app/README.mbt.md",
      "line": 34,
      "kinds": [
        "ptp_messages"
      ],
      "text": "|       +-- Component(pending)                      app.mbt: queued input, \"Follow-up: <text>\"",
      "excerpt_start_column": 1,
      "match_column": 77
    },
    {
      "path": "tui_app/README.mbt.md",
      "line": 60,
      "kinds": [
        "ptp_messages"
      ],
      "text": "|      Follow-up: queued input                                             |",
      "excerpt_start_column": 1,
      "match_column": 8
    },
    {
      "path": "tui_app/app_test.mbt",
      "line": 4,
      "kinds": [
        "ptp_messages"
      ],
      "text": "/// 排队中的 follow-up 消息也占 dock 的行:多行消息必须一行一个元素,否则后半段会被",
